>Does anyone know how one would go about hacking the VAX's?

Spoilers






















Since you ask this question, I assume you've already gotten to the
bottom level of the "Dwarvish Tech Center."  Here's what you must do:

1)  Stand on the pulsating square (it will be next to one of the
VAX's).
2)  Zap a wand of secret door detection.  A door will appear on the
nearest VAX.
3)  Enter the door and you enter Cyberspace!  (warning:  you should be
at least 14th level before you attempt this).

Hack your way through cyberspace, killing all the worms, viruses, and
bugs.  Destroy the master hacker and collect the Bell of Opening.

 

